ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nAunt Zhang is a rural woman, she does not receive any education, she always believes that \"a woman without talent is virtuous\". Her niece, Xiao Hong, is a top student, she hopes to convince Aunt Zhang that girls can also have talents and dreams.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiao Hong convince Aunt Zhang?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. She recommends Aunt Zhang to read some books about women's self-improvement.\nB. She introduces some talented women in history to Aunt Zhang, such as Madame Curie, Wu Zetian, etc.\nC. She explains to Aunt Zhang that many women are able to successfully balance family and career.\nD. She analyzes the predicaments that women who only rely on men may encounter, explaining that with the progress of the times, the diversity of women's roles becomes a part of social development.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035935159966481375,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e087d6006945d27fc40a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367623581,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c399488d40d942ed957d6cef8d836334"}